Note: This MIT license covers the source code in this repository.

The application loads third-party data and imagery at runtime (NASA JPL,
Hipparcos / Yale BSC, IAU constellations, AWS Open Terrain, Esri World
Imagery, OpenStreetMap, Solar System Scope textures). Each source has its
own license — see README.md "第三方資料來源 / 授權" and LICENSE-CONTENT.md
for details. Notably, Esri World Imagery is free for personal / development
use only; public commercial deployments require an ArcGIS Developer account.
